<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Overview</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>project<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>C/C++<sp/>course-project<sp/>template:<sp/>a<sp/>small<sp/>`utility`<sp/>library,<sp/>a<sp/>`calculator`<sp/>library</highlight></codeline>
