<codeline><highlight class="normal">googletest<sp/>suite,<sp/>wired<sp/>up<sp/>with<sp/>CMake<sp/>+<sp/>CTest.<sp/>It<sp/>generates<sp/>two<sp/>independent<sp/>HTML<sp/>reports<sp/>for<sp/>every</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">report<sp/>family<sp/>(a<sp/>third-party<sp/>one<sp/>via<sp/>[ReportGenerator](https://github.com/danielpalme/ReportGenerator)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">and<sp/>the<sp/>ecosystem&apos;s<sp/>native/older<sp/>tool),<sp/>Doxygen<sp/>API<sp/>documentation,<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>site<sp/>that<sp/>links<sp/>all<sp/>of<sp/>them.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">See<sp/>[docs/reports.md](docs/reports.md)<sp/>(&quot;Which<sp/>report<sp/>is<sp/>which?&quot;)<sp/>once<sp/>you<sp/>have<sp/>built<sp/>it.</highlight></codeline>
