<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>are<sp/>using<sp/>[GitHub<sp/>-<sp/>inorton/junit2html:<sp/>Turn<sp/>Junit<sp/>XML<sp/>reports<sp/>into<sp/>self<sp/>contained<sp/>HTML<sp/>reports](https://github.com/inorton/junit2html)<sp/>to<sp/>convert<sp/>junit<sp/>xml<sp/>formatted<sp/>test<sp/>results<sp/>to<sp/>HTML<sp/>page<sp/>for<sp/>reporting<sp/>also<sp/>we<sp/>store<sp/>logs<sp/>during<sp/>test.<sp/>Use<sp/>following<sp/>commands<sp/>to<sp/>install<sp/>this<sp/>module<sp/>with<sp/>pip</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```bash</highlight></codeline>
